 "hast": "\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h2 id=\"modify-your-tailwindcss-file\">Modify your tailwind.css file</h2><p>Add <code>:root[class~=\"dark\"]</code> to your tailwind.css file. This will allow you to use the <code>dark</code> class on your html element to apply dark mode styles.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">app/tailwind.css</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\".dark,\n:root[class~=&#x22;dark&#x22;] {\n  ...;\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">.dark</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">:root</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">~=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"dark\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ...;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><h2 id=\"install-remix-themes\">Install remix-themes</h2><p>Start by installing <code>remix-themes</code>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style